.TH "gnutls_pubkey_export_mldsa_raw" 3 "3.8.14" "gnutls" "gnutls"
.SH NAME
gnutls_pubkey_export_mldsa_raw \- API function
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <gnutls/abstract.h>
.sp
.BI "int gnutls_pubkey_export_mldsa_raw(gnutls_pubkey_t " key ", gnutls_datum_t * " pub ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "gnutls_pubkey_t key" 12
Holds the public key
.IP "gnutls_datum_t * pub" 12
will hold the raw public key (may be \fBNULL\fP)
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
This function will export the ML\-DSA public key found in  \fIkey\fP as a
raw octet string (FIPS 204 / NIST ML\-DSA public key encoding).  The
buffer is allocated using \fBgnutls_malloc()\fP and stored in  \fIpub\fP .  The
ML\-DSA parameter set can be obtained with
\fBgnutls_pubkey_get_pk_algorithm()\fP.

This is intended for applications such as DNSSEC that need the raw
public key material rather than a SubjectPublicKeyInfo encoding.
.SH "RETURNS"
\fBGNUTLS_E_SUCCESS\fP on success, otherwise a negative error code.
.SH "SINCE"
3.8.14
